  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f2e5a01826c23e3438f06c628b14f2bd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cooldown: 0
  debug: 0
  talk_on_start: 0
  allow_bad_words: 1
  talking_delay_range: {x: 30, y: 60}
  talks_random:
  - here we go again/.
  - well/.i'm not dead yet :D/lthat's a good start
  - give me some noodles !/l/.anyone ?
  - still not dead/./lbut am i alive ?
  - 'let''s decrypt

    the chaos, babyy'
  - ARGHHH/.ZOMBOS !
  - 'those posters reminds

    me of the pixel war/./lwait/.wtf is the pixel war
    ?'
  - looks like life has/./lno meaning after all
  - 'let''s ctrl+alt+suppr

    all those cyberzombies'
  - 'do you feel the

    breath of the city ?'
  - i'm talking alone/./las always..
  - 'bits & bytes are

    my only love, honey'
  - '404: noodles not found :/'
  - 'feel like the labyrinth

    keeps moving/.is it ?'
  - omg i almost glitched oO
  - 'what if i could pass

    through those walls ?/lwell/.I can''t'
  - this city is full of bugs/./llooks like a game actually
  - ahh, the smell of the city,/lso/.digital
  - i'm a pixel runner/.i'm a pixel runner
  - let's hack the world, baby !
  - 'running in da

    underground,/lagain/.and again/.n agn'
  - 'i''m so tired/./lwhen was the last

    time i slept ?'
  - 'why do i keep

    running, really ?'
  - this wall looks suspicious/. O.o
  - feels good to run after/./l502420h of debugging
  - here i dash/.here i slash
  - 'where is my old

    friend Marco ?'
  - 'ayy, 9 years without

    seeing the sun,/lwho can beat that ?'
  - i need to find the exit/./lis there even an exit ?
  - 'ahhh what if I

    could ctrl-Z irl ?'
  - alright./ltime to remember passwords/./ls7j3k9../lwell/.not this time apparently
  - what's my name again ?
  - 'ahh/./lI love feeling the

    bytes flowing in my veins..'
  - where is the internet again ?
  - 'zombos, zombos

    everywhere/./lwelcome to the

    zapocalypse'
  - 'noodles,/lthe ultimate cure

    for existential hunger !'
  - starving and debugging/./la perfect combo, really
  - 'is this reality or just

    a weird illusion ?'
  - zombos & hacking/./lno way it's real/./lit's so/.mainstream
  - 'OH MY GOD,/ljust found the bug

    I was struggling with/./lToo bad my computer

    passed
    away..'
  - "line 475,car. 45 :\n(WorldError)\nhere's comes the \"d\xE9j\xE0 vu\""
  - looks like the matrix/./lugh ?/lwhat did I just say ?
  - 'i could use a jetpack/./lwell no that''s

    another game./lwait/.a game ?'
  - ohhh, cuty rat !
  - 'why do I keep

    talking alone ?/l;-;'
  - 'i''m so tired of

    running/l/.looks like

    I can''t stop'
  - 'how many times

    I''ve been here ?'
  - 'mmmmh/./lhow many zombos lives is

    worth some noodles ?'
  - 'pff !/lthose zombos are

    so annoying'
  - 'ahh/./lloneliness is almost

    as scary as

    the deep web'
  - 'maybe I''ll find

    some friends/./l/. but I want noodles !'
  talks_random_bad_words:
  - 'fuck this shit/.

    i''m HUNGRY !'
  - 'is all of this

    sh*t even real ?'
  - 'ahh orangina I love that/l/.f*ck capitalism

    perchance'
  - fuck Google I'm gonna hack them
